        # 2. {(0,0), (1,0), (1,1), (2,1)}
        # 3. {(0,0), (0,1), (1,1), (1,2)}
        # 4. {(0,1), (0,2), (1,0), (1,1)}
        # These are the 4 rotations of the Z-tetramino.
